{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/blog/2010-05-12-wpf-listviewitem-commands-with-mvvm-pattern/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>If you're interested to see how to attach commands to listview items for use with an implementation of the MVVM pattern, have a look at this.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"xml\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-xml line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>Style</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\"><span class=\"token namespace\">x:</span>Key</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>Local_OpenEntityStyle<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n           <span class=\"token attr-name\">TargetType</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>{x:Type ListViewItem}<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>Setter</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">Property</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>acb:CommandBehavior.Event<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n                        <span class=\"token attr-name\">Value</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>MouseDoubleClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">/></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>Setter</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">Property</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>acb:CommandBehavior.Command<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n                        <span class=\"token attr-name\">Value</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>{Binding ElementName=uiEntityListDisplay, Path=DataContext.OpenEntityCommand}<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">/></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>Setter</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">Property</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>acb:CommandBehavior.CommandParameter<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n                        <span class=\"token attr-name\">Value</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>{Binding}<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>Style</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","timeToRead":1,"excerpt":"If you're interested to see how to attach commands to listview items for use with an implementation of the MVVM pattern, have a look at this.","frontmatter":{"title":"WPF ListViewItem Commands with MVVM pattern","date":"12 May 2010","category":"XAML & Desktop","tags":["wpf","mvvm","data binding"],"image":null}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2010-05-12-wpf-listviewitem-commands-with-mvvm-pattern/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["764694655"],"slicesMap":{}}